<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>claude-haiku-4.5 | 미디어아트</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --secondary: #ec4899;
            --accent: #14b8a6;
            --dark: #0f172a;
            --light: #f8fafc;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --text-light: #64748b;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --text: #f1f5f9;
                --text-light: #cbd5e1;
                --dark: #0f172a;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, #1e293b 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .canvas-wrapper {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 90%;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
        }

        .title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 50%, var(--accent) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem);
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 3vw, 1.1rem);
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        button:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
        }

        button:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        button:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }

        .accessibility-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            z-index: 100;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .accessibility-toggle button {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            padding: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .accessibility-toggle {
                bottom: 15px;
                right: 15px;
            }

            .accessibility-toggle button {
                width: 45px;
                height: 45px;
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }

        body.reduce-motion * {
            animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
            transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        }

        body.high-contrast {
            --primary: #0066ff;
            --secondary: #ff0066;
            --accent: #00ff99;
        }

        body.high-contrast .content {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }

        body.high-contrast button {
            border-width: 3px;
        }

        .info-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-top: 20px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .particle {
            position: absolute;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            body {
                --primary: #6366f1;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="canvas-wrapper">
        <canvas id="canvas"></canvas>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <h1 class="title">claude-haiku-4.5</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">대화형 AI 미디어아트</p>
            <p class="description">
                빠르고 효율적인 사고의 흐름을 시각화합니다.<br>
                클릭하거나 터치하여 상호작용하세요.
            </p>
            <div class="controls">
                <button onclick="toggleAnimation()" aria-label="애니메이션 토글">
                    ▶ 시작
                </button>
                <button onclick="resetCanvas()" aria-label="캔버스 초기화">
                    ↻ 초기화
                </button>
            </div>
            <p class="info-text">
                키보드: 스페이스바로 애니메이션 토글 | 엔터로 초기화
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accessibility-toggle">
        <button onclick="toggleReduceMotion()" aria-label="움직임 감소 토글" title="움직임 감소">
            ⏸
        </button>
        <button onclick="toggleHighContrast()" aria-label="고대비 토글" title="고대비">
            ◐
        </button>
    </div>

    <script>
        const canvas = document.getElementById('canvas');
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');

        let animationRunning = true;
        let particles = [];
        let nodes = [];
        let time = 0;

        function resizeCanvas() {
            canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
            canvas.height = window.innerHeight;
        }

        class Particle {
            constructor(x, y) {
                this.x = x;
                this.y = y;
                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 4;
                this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 4;
                this.life = 1;
                this.decay = Math.random() * 0.01 + 0.005;
                this.size = Math.random() * 3 + 1;
                this.hue = Math.random() * 60 + 200;
            }

            update() {
                this.x += this.vx;
                this.y += this.vy;
                this.life -= this.decay;
                this.vy += 0.1;
            }

            draw(ctx) {
                ctx.save();
                ctx.globalAlpha = this.life;
                ctx.fillStyle = `hsl(${this.hue}, 100%, 50%)`;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.restore();
            }
        }

        class Node {
            constructor(x, y) {
                this.x = x;
                this.y = y;
                this.targetX = x;
                this.targetY = y;
                this.vx = 0;
                this.vy = 0;
                this.size = Math.random() * 4 + 2;
                this.hue = Math.random() * 60 + 200;
            }

            update() {
                this.targetX = canvas.width * (0.2 + Math.sin(time * 0.001 + this.hue) * 0.3);
                this.targetY = canvas.height * (0.2 + Math.cos(time * 0.0008 + this.hue) * 0.3);

                this.vx += (this.targetX - this.x) * 0.02;
                this.vy += (this.targetY - this.y) * 0.02;

                this.vx *= 0.95;
                this.vy *= 0.95;

                this.x += this.vx;
                this.y += this.vy;
            }

            draw(ctx) {
                ctx.fillStyle = `hsl(${this.hue}, 100%, 60%)`;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();

                ctx.strokeStyle = `hsl(${this.hue}, 100%, 50%)`;
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.3;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size * 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.stroke();
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
            }
        }

        function initNodes() {
            nodes = [];
            for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
                const angle = (i / 8) * Math.PI * 2;
                const x = canvas.width / 2 + Math.cos(angle) * 100;
                const y = canvas.height / 2 + Math.sin(angle) * 100;
                nodes.push(new Node(x, y));
            }
        }

        function drawConnections() {
            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2)';
            ctx.lineWidth = 1;

            for (let i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
                for (let j = i + 1; j < nodes.length; j++) {
                    const dx = nodes[i].x - nodes[j].x;
                    const dy = nodes[i].y - nodes[j].y;
                    const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);

                    if (distance < 200) {
                        ctx.globalAlpha = 1 - distance / 200;
                        ctx.beginPath();
                        ctx.moveTo(nodes[i].x, nodes[i].y);
                        ctx.lineTo(nodes[j].x, nodes[j].y);
                        ctx.stroke();
                    }
                }
            }
            ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
        }

        function animate() {
            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1)';
            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);

            if (animationRunning) {
                time++;

                nodes.forEach(node => {
                    node.update();
                    node.draw(ctx);

                    if (Math.random() < 0.3) {
                        particles.push(new Particle(node.x, node.y));
                    }
                });

                drawConnections();
            }

            particles = particles.filter(p => p.life > 0);
            particles.forEach(p => {
                p.update();
                p.draw(ctx);
            });

            requestAnimationFrame(animate);
        }

        function toggleAnimation() {
            animationRunning = !animationRunning;
        }

        function resetCanvas() {
            particles = [];
            time = 0;
            initNodes();
        }

        function toggleReduceMotion() {
            document.body.classList.toggle('reduce-motion');
        }

        function toggleHighContrast() {
            document.body.classList.toggle('high-contrast');
        }

        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.code === 'Space') {
                e.preventDefault();
                toggleAnimation();
            }
            if (e.code === 'Enter') {
                e.preventDefault();
                resetCanvas();
            }
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('click', () => {
            particles = [];
            initNodes();
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            particles = [];
            initNodes();
        });

        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);

        resizeCanvas();
        initNodes();
        animate();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

이 미디어아트 웹페이지는 다음과 같은 특징을 가집니다:

**시각 표현:**
- 8개의 노드가 유기적으로 움직이며 상호 연결되는 네트워크 시각화
- 입자 효과로 동적인 에너지 표현
- 그라데이션 배경과 블러 효과로 깊이감 표현

**상호작용:**
- 클릭/터치로 입자 재생성
- 스페이스바로 애니메이션 토글
- 엔터로 초기화
- 버튼 인터페이스

**접근성:**
- 고대비 모드 (◐ 버튼)
- 움직임 감소 모드 (⏸ 버튼)
- 키보드 네비게이션 완벽 지원
- 포커스 표시 명확
- 반응형 디자인 (모바일/데스크톱)
- 읽기 쉬운 폰트와 충분한 대비

**기술:**
- 순수 HTML/CSS/JavaScript
- 외부 리소스 없음
- Canvas API로 실시간 렌더링
